---
source: crates/monospace/src/frame.rs
description: "A picture of the screen, as the frame paints it. The three regions are counted under the picture: the bar across the top, the region the diagram goes into, and the status bar along the bottom. The count of the cells that are not blank is there because a picture alone cannot say how much of the screen is spoken for, and because a number that is derived from the frame cannot be wrong the way a hand-written expectation is."
expression: body
